%description:
The UE's servingNodeId parameter was renamed to lteServingNodeId. A configuration that
still sets the old name is an error, instead of the UE silently starting on the default
serving node. (The lteServingNodeId = default line undoes the assignment of defaults.ini,
so the UE is configured as a configuration that never set the new name.)

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.EpcSessionTestNetwork

*.ue[*].servingNodeId = 1
*.ue[*].lteServingNodeId = default

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
Parameter 'servingNodeId' was renamed to 'lteServingNodeId', set that one instead
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
